  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Drain sweetcorn.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62f31b4d57d4c6ac0806a407/step-5e3c8e04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 5 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl. Set aside.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add plant-based beef mince and carrot and cook, breaking up the beef with a spoon, until browned, 4-5 minutes. Drain any excess oil from the pan. TIP: Cover the pan with a lid if the corn kernels are popping\" out.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62f31b4d57d4c6ac0806a407/step-db7ba1a2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• SPICY! You may find the spice blend hot! Add less if you're sensitive to heat. Add the butter and Mexican Fiesta spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add diced tomatoes with garlic & onion, the sugar and the salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then simmer until thickened, 5 minutes. TIP: Add a splash of water to loosen the filling, if needed.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62f31b4d57d4c6ac0806a407/step-d565118f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the grill to medium-high. Drizzle a baking dish with olive oil.\n• Lay a mini flour tortilla on a chopping board. Spoon some beef filling down the centre, then roll it up tightly and place, seam side-down, in the baking dish.\n• Repeat with remaining filling and tortillas, ensuring they fit together snugly in the dish. Sprinkle with shredded Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill enchiladas until cheese is melted and golden and tortillas are warmed through, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62f31b4d57d4c6ac0806a407/step-830e4843.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice spring onion.\n• To the bowl with the charred corn, add spring onion and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil.\n• Toss to combine. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62f31b4d57d4c6ac0806a407/step-ec6bb2b6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mexican beef enchiladas between plates.\n• Top with corn salsa and light sour cream to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62f31b4d57d4c6ac0806a407/step-aeece048.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
